WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.751
I'm so happy!

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:08.758
Hinode? Hinode!

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:15.265
Muge!

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:19.519
-Hinode! No! Not Hinode!
-Hey! Behave!

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.646
Stop that!

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:23.857
I have to go back to being a human!

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:27.110
What?

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:36.286
Hey! You have to
take better care of your life!

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:39.664
It belongs to me now!

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:42.167
Hey, hey! Come back here!

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.670
What's going on?

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:52.469
Hinode shouldn't be here!
He has to go back!

00:00:53.344 --> 00:00:57.474
He said he wants to study pottery.
He wants to be like his grandpa!

00:00:58.641 --> 00:00:59.517
Hinode! Over here!

00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:04.397
Muge!

00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:07.734
Muge!

00:01:08.651 --> 00:01:09.652
Hinode!

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:15.825
Excuse me, is that going up?

00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:17.994
What? Oh, yes.

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:20.080
Can I hitch a ride?

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.498
Oh, sure thing!

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.667
Is that going up?

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.503
All clear!

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.005
-Is that going up?
-Go!

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.594
Hinode!

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:41.893
Hinode! No!

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.187
Go back!

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.360
-Seriously?
-What?

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.028
Muge!

00:01:54.405 --> 00:01:55.240
Hinode!

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.120
Hinode!

00:02:06.584 --> 00:02:07.877
You can do it, Hinode!

00:02:18.888 --> 00:02:20.056
Let's go home, Muge.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.724
I...

00:02:24.561 --> 00:02:25.728
Hinode, I--

00:02:29.566 --> 00:02:30.400
I'm sorry.

00:02:30.775 --> 00:02:32.569
Why are you apologizing?

00:02:34.237 --> 00:02:37.282
I'm not the sharpest tool in the shed.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.784
I only realize who's been supporting me

00:02:40.076 --> 00:02:43.830
behind my back when they're gone.

00:02:44.455 --> 00:02:46.624
I've always been like this.

00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:47.750
I...

00:02:48.626 --> 00:02:52.589
I finally realized the truth
when I learned you were actually Taro.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:57.635
You cheer me up at school.
It was always you.

00:02:58.094 --> 00:03:01.306
Wait, really? Do you mean that, Hinode?

00:03:01.806 --> 00:03:05.101
And that's why I have to change! I--

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.148
You should stay the way you are.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:11.774
Mask Seller!

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:15.153
I'll take your lifespan too...

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:18.948
-as compensation.
-Let go of him!

